Package: pars-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         parslinux-gnome-settings | pardus-gnome-settings,
         parslinux-grub-theme | pardus-bilge-grub-theme,
         desktop-base
Recommends: adw-gtk3-theme,
            fonts-ubuntu,
            fastfetch,
            parslinux-about,
            plymouth,
            plymouth-themes
Breaks: pardus-backgrounds
Replaces: pardus-backgrounds
Description: ParsLinux Brand Identity, Wallpapers and Theme Metapackage
 This package provides the official visual identity for ParsLinux:
  * ParsLinux official wallpapers and GNOME background settings
  * Vector SVG brand logos and application icons
  * Fastfetch ASCII artwork and terminal system configuration
  * Distribution release identity (os-release and issue)
  * System branding dependencies (GTK themes, icons, grub theme)
